00:02:30.723 --> 00:02:34.645
And Michael Angelo's
peers went to the Pope

00:02:34.645 --> 00:02:38.067
who what Julis II and
they said to the Pope,

00:02:38.067 --> 00:02:39.359
why don't you get Michael Angelo

00:02:39.359 --> 00:02:41.859
