00:03:57.896 --> 00:04:00.606
There were paint issues, he
had to deal with the fact that

00:04:00.606 --> 00:04:04.196
the Pope was very ill and he
thought he might not get paid.

00:04:04.196 --> 00:04:07.826
He actually developed this
incredible elaborate system

00:04:07.826 --> 00:04:11.993
of scaffolding which allowed
him to back backwards

00:04:13.011 --> 00:04:16.055
for four years on the
Sistine Chapel and he damaged

00:04:16.055 --> 00:04:19.809
