but he did it for the art.

00:04:19.809 --> 00:04:22.609
He did it for the discipline,
he did it for what it made of

00:04:22.609 --> 00:04:25.851
him, he did it for his
commitment because the great

00:04:25.851 --> 00:04:29.009
