Bach's, society teaches us

00:05:54.488 --> 00:05:58.206
and trains us that these
people are somehow born

00:05:58.206 --> 00:06:01.915
with special talents and
what I'm here to remind you,

00:06:01.915 --> 00:06:05.832
a deep respect for all
25,000 or 24,922 on this

00:06:07.835 --> 00:06:10.707
