00:06:58.706 --> 00:07:02.992
- The first idea is to
emotionally engage with

00:07:02.992 --> 00:07:06.075
that dream each morning of your life.

00:07:08.204 --> 00:07:10.161
See, a lot of people
don't actually struggle

00:07:10.161 --> 00:07:14.329
with the discipline part in
terms of the doing the thing.

00:07:14.329 --> 00:07:17.877
It's that they're not getting
revved up to do the thing.

00:07:17.877 --> 00:07:20.373
In other words, we got a
problem with motivation,

00:07:20.373 --> 00:07:22.419
not necessarily just discipline.

00:07:22.419 --> 00:07:24.836
We have a problem with,
that once in a while, you

00:07:24.836 --> 00:07:27.130
hit it, you do it, you do the work.

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:28.964
But a lot of times you
fall off because you're

00:07:28.964 --> 00:07:30.974
not emotionally engaged in it.

00:07:30.974 --> 00:07:32.884
It's like, if you want
a lot of discipline,

00:07:32.884 --> 00:07:36.308
you need a high level
of emotional connection

00:07:36.308 --> 00:07:38.350
and focus on that thing that
you want to work towards.

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:40.810
So every morning, what
I want you to do is just

00:07:40.810 --> 00:07:43.060
start a new visualization practice.

00:07:43.060 --> 00:07:45.309
When you wake up in the
morning, close your eyes,

00:07:45.309 --> 00:07:48.273
think about the dream,
the aspiration, the thing

00:07:48.273 --> 00:07:52.689
that you're really after in
life and just visualize it.

00:07:52.689 --> 00:07:54.859
And it really gets yourself
emotionally attached,

00:07:54.859 --> 00:07:56.485
emotionally engaged with it.

00:07:56.485 --> 00:07:58.573
Think about how great it will
feel for you to have that

00:07:58.573 --> 00:08:02.868
thing or be that thing
or contribute that thing,

00:08:02.868 --> 00:08:05.036
to make that difference,
just think about it.

00:08:05.036 --> 00:08:07.208
Allow it to well up in
your heart a little bit.

00:08:07.208 --> 00:08:10.416
Get excited about it, remember the dream.

00:08:10.416 --> 00:08:12.466
That's why we get away from
discipline because we're

00:08:12.466 --> 00:08:15.174
so busy with the chaos
of the world that we

00:08:15.174 --> 00:08:18.049
emotionally are no longer
attached in a way that

00:08:18.049 --> 00:08:20.305
our brain says, hey, man, focus on this.

00:08:20.305 --> 00:08:23.301
It's important to you, remember?

00:08:23.301 --> 00:08:27.141
So if your heart is
disengaged, it's difficult to

00:08:27.141 --> 00:08:31.308
stay disciplined so every
morning make it a practice

00:08:32.153 --> 00:08:35.867
to actually just imagine
the pay off, the benefit,

00:08:35.867 --> 00:08:38.784
the contribution, the
art, the thing that you do

00:08:38.784 --> 00:08:41.530
and are doing and do contribute.

00:08:41.530 --> 00:08:44.366
If you can do that more
often, you'll be more fired up

00:08:44.366 --> 00:08:46.532
and you'll stay back on track.

00:08:46.532 --> 00:08:49.200
- Number two, set up hard
and fast rules in your life,

00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:51.164
rules that cannot be violated.

00:08:51.164 --> 00:08:53.749
'Cause from a willpower
perspective, it is very

00:08:53.749 --> 00:08:55.757
draining again, to go back
and forth in your head.

00:08:55.757 --> 00:08:58.515
So it's much easier to say,
okay, I will not drink soda

00:08:58.515 --> 00:09:01.141
and I'll only eat foods
off of this list than it is

00:09:01.141 --> 00:09:03.809
for you to go okay, I
ate really good yesterday

00:09:03.809 --> 00:09:05.857
and I worked out extra
hard, now I'm at dinner.

00:09:05.857 --> 00:09:07.489
And they just gave me a
free dessert, is it okay

00:09:07.489 --> 00:09:09.078
for me to have a small portion?

00:09:09.078 --> 00:09:11.872
'Cause that takes a lot of
mental energy to process.

00:09:11.872 --> 00:09:13.540
When you set up hard and
fast rules, as draconian

00:09:13.540 --> 00:09:16.456
as this might feel and
sound at first, it actually

00:09:16.456 --> 00:09:19.084
creates a tremendous amount
of freedom in your own life

00:09:19.084 --> 00:09:20.914
to spend your brain power on the

00:09:20.914 --> 00:09:22.080
things that matter the most.

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:25.046
So set up rules, you must
work between these hours.

00:09:25.046 --> 00:09:26.626
You need to go to the
gym five days a week.

00:09:26.626 --> 00:09:28.715
For me, I set up a rule,
I have to release one

00:09:28.715 --> 00:09:31.131
